00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,244
Think of it as the gap between the two electrodes on the potential ladder.

2
00:00:04,244 --> 00:00:13,190
For the Daniell cell, copper at plus zero point three four is the cathode, zinc at minus zero point seven six is the anode.

3
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:16,510
The gap is one point one zero volts.

